---
/**
 * 04 · Sea glass
 *
 * A tumbled, frosted, imperfect thing that has been kept a long time and is
 * still translucent. There is not a straight edge anywhere on it, but the wear
 * is distributed rather than lopsided: the silhouette's own centre of mass sits
 * on 16, 16, so the face reads dead centre while the outline stays hand-worn.
 * It fills the full 28 safe area. Health data as something old and softened and
 * quietly held, rather than something mined.
 */
